[38;2;124;124;124meach edge is colored red or blue, with no monochromatic triangle.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mA monochromatic triangle means a triangle with all 3 edges the same color.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mLet me think about this. We have a graph G on 9 vertices, with some edges [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mcolored red and some blue. We want no monochromatic triangle. Maximize the [0m
